# Statamic default and fields are untouchable

This outranks every other rule in this addon. Same rule as `~/.cursor/rules/00-statamic-default-urorligt.mdc`.

Do not change, replace, wrap, or hijack Statamic's normal field behaviour in the Control Panel. Display name, handle, instructions, defaults, integers, text, replicator, grid, bard — they keep working as Statamic ships them.

Only **build on top**. Changing Statamic default is allowed only when the user explicitly asks for that change **in this message**.

## Forbidden

- Subclass + `::register()` on an existing handle (`iconify`, `replicator`, `text`, …)
- Wrap/replace a field's Vue component
- `npm run cp:build` here or on the site when it rebuilds `addon.js` — that breaks field settings
- Overwrite `public/vendor/app/` or `public/vendor/statamic-addon/`
- Change `DefaultSetsFieldtype.js` (bundled in `addon-DmXwhlR7.js`)
- CSS that hits native inputs
- `appendConfigFields` on `Fieldtype::class` so every field's settings break

## Allowed (on top of Statamic)

- `appendConfigFields` on **one** fieldtype, adding a setting, class untouched
- A **separate** small script, never a new `addon.js`
- YAML `default:` in fieldsets
